{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"What Prim’s algorithm reports, in order, with the events of the Boost Graph Library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Dijkstra visitor, which its Prim uses.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/edgeNotRelaxed(_:weight:)","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/edgeRelaxed(_:weight:)","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/examine(_:edge:weight:)","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/examineEdge(_:weight:)","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/startVertex(_:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/PrimEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/SQ","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/SH","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PrimEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Weigh